NAME
    gcloud container workload profiles manifests - generate optimized
        Kubernetes manifests

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud container workload profiles manifests COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Generate optimized Kubernetes manifests.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Generate optimized Kubernetes manifests for a given workload profile.
